    rdfs:comment "ForConstruction / ForReview / ForApproval / ForInformation / AsBuilt / Superseded. SHACL constrains via sh:in (string literal, no sh:class — same idiom as DrawingChangeShape). Domain unspecified (antipattern #8)." ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

<https://w3id.org/IproK/document#rfiAnswer> a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
